---
// Mission / Philosophy section
---

<section data-section="mission" class="section-container flex-col justify-center text-center px-8 md:px-24 lg:px-32">
  <div class="divider mb-16"></div>

  <p class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold leading-relaxed md:leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-balance max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">设计</span>
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">不是</span>
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">装饰，</span>
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;">而是</span>
    <br />
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block gold-accent italic" style="animation-delay: 1.2s;">生活方式的</span>
    <span class="opacity-0 animate-fade-up inline-block gold-accent italic" style="animation-delay: 1.4s;">精准翻译</span>
  </p>

  <div class="mt-20 max-w-xl mx-auto opacity-0 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 1.8s;">
    <p class="text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-subtle text-balance">
      我们相信空间的力量——它塑造情绪、引导行为、定义关系。<br/>
      每一次设计，都是从倾听开始，以共鸣结束的旅程。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider mt-20"></div>
</section>
